      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "A British court convicts two Iranian men of spying on journalists from London-based broadcaster Iran International. One of them is also convicted of preparing a violent attack, while a third defendant is acquitted.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-12:12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "He was convicted of \"preparing an assassination and aggravated arson\" and sentenced to eight years and six months in prison, after another plotter, an Afghan national, was convicted.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384678308:46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-12T00:00:16Z",
      "text": "Iranian external operations refer to the activities conducted by the Islamic Republic of Iran in foreign countries since the 1979 Islamic Revolution.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384678308:0"
      ]
    },
    {
